Subject: [PATCH] Kindling: Optional limit for minecart pushes per tick


diff --git a/net/minecraft/world/entity/vehicle/minecart/OldMinecartBehavior.java b/net/minecraft/world/entity/vehicle/minecart/OldMinecartBehavior.java
index 615737bf848486c3399b30edd3986df83aed24df..29a2b4ac70056bcc688f0953233ca09f339a85cb 100644
